The optional CLIP image-embedding feature (off by default; see
`image_embeddings` in the config) shells out to a Python script that
resolves its own dependencies via `uv` at runtime and downloads the
clip-ViT-B-32 weights from Hugging Face. Those components are not
bundled or distributed with mnemo.

The optional vault clustering embeddings/labelling engines (off by
default; see `vault_clustering` in the config) call Voyage AI and/or
Anthropic only when explicitly opted in. Those services are not
bundled or distributed with mnemo.
